Panther ROM manifests
=====================

This repository contains the source manifest for an unofficial, community-maintained Android 17 / LineageOS 24.0-based build for Google Pixel 7 (`panther`).

This project is independent and is not affiliated with or endorsed by LineageOS or Google. The manifest references upstream projects, including LineageOS and AOSP repositories; their names, copyrights, and license terms remain with their respective owners.

Source repositories
-------------------

The manifest combines upstream projects; this organization does not own or maintain every source repository. The Pixel 7 device repositories currently resolve to:

| Component | Source |
| --- | --- |
| Android / LineageOS base manifest | [LineageOS/android, lineage-24.0](https://github.com/LineageOS/android/tree/lineage-24.0) |
| Pixel 7 device tree | [LineageOS/android_device_google_panther](https://github.com/LineageOS/android_device_google_panther/tree/lineage-24.0) |
| Shared Pixel device tree | [LineageOS/android_device_google_pantah](https://github.com/LineageOS/android_device_google_pantah/tree/lineage-24.0) |
| Tensor G2 common device tree | [LineageOS/android_device_google_gs201](https://github.com/LineageOS/android_device_google_gs201/tree/lineage-24.0) |
| Pixel device kernels | [LineageOS/android_device_google_pantah-kernels](https://github.com/LineageOS/android_device_google_pantah-kernels) |
| Proprietary Pixel 7 vendor files | [TheMuppets/proprietary_vendor_google_panther](https://github.com/TheMuppets/proprietary_vendor_google_panther/tree/lineage-24.0) |

This project's manifest changes and release artifacts are maintained separately:

- [Panther ROM manifests](https://github.com/lineage-panther/android_manifests)
- [Panther ROM releases, issues, and contribution guidance](https://github.com/lineage-panther/panther-release-24.0)

Getting started
---------------

Initialize and sync the source tree:

```
repo init -u https://github.com/lineage-panther/android_manifests.git -b lineage-24.0 --git-lfs
repo sync -c -j4
```

Configure the Pixel 7 build:

```
source build/envsetup.sh
breakfast panther
```

Building requires the Android build dependencies and sufficient disk space and memory.

Project support and contributions
---------------------------------

- Report build issues or request features in the [Panther ROM issue tracker](https://github.com/lineage-panther/panther-release-24.0/issues/new/choose).
- Submit changes to manifests and this documentation as pull requests to this repository.
- ROM source changes belong in the repository that owns the affected component. Many manifest entries currently point to upstream projects, so this manifest repository cannot accept code changes for those projects. File an issue with the affected project path and proposed change while a project fork is not available.

Keep upstream copyright notices and license files intact. Do not include proprietary apps or private device data in issues or pull requests.
